{"seq":2,"slug":"rent-to-own-conversion-residual-settlement","title":"租转售转换与残值买断结算：把「已付租金」折算成「买断成交价」","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/rental-access-commerce-reservation-inventory-asset-lifecycle/crossborder-rent-to-own-platform-governance/rent-to-own-conversion-residual-settlement","wordCount":3001,"readingTime":13,"html":"<h1 id=\"租转售转换与残值买断结算-把-已付租金-折算成-买断成交价\">租转售转换与残值买断结算：把「已付租金」折算成「买断成交价」</h1><p>一台租了 14 个月的高端笔记本，租客决定不还了，想直接买下来。此刻平台面对的问题不是「卖不卖」，而是「卖多少钱才既不亏掉资产剩余价值、又不违反监管对租转售的定性、还能跨境结算清楚」。租转售（rent-to-own，RTO）的转换结算，本质是把一条未完成的租赁现金流曲线，在某一个时点截断，折算成一个一次性成交价。上游资产唯一标识与状态机见<a href=\"../rental-model-serialized-asset-registry/asset-availability-state-machine-lifecycle-unit\">资产可用性状态机与生命周期单元</a>，归还后的处置分级见<a href=\"../fulfillment-reverse-asset-lifecycle/return-inspection-cleaning-refurbishment-pipeline\">归还验机、清洁翻新与再上架流水线</a>——本文只回答：转换时点、价格公式、会计税务定性、跨境结算四件事。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-买断价是-残值减去已付租金抵扣-不是-打折出售\">核心概念：买断价是「残值减去已付租金抵扣」，不是「打折出售」</h2><p>零售促销的打折是营销决策，租转售的买断价是<strong>合同与会计共同约束下的一个残值结算</strong>。它有两个同时成立的锚：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>buyout</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.8em\" maxsize=\"1.8em\">(</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mi>R</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mo>−</mo><mtext>  </mtext><msub><mi>K</mi><mtext>credit</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mi>F</mi><mtext>  </mtext><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.8em\" maxsize=\"1.8em\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{\\text{buyout}}(t) \\;=\\; \\max\\Big(\\; R(t) \\;-\\; K_{\\text{credit}}(t),\\; F \\;\\Big)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">buyout</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.8em;vertical-align:-0.65em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">(</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.8em;vertical-align:-0.65em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">credit</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是资产在租期的第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 个月末的账面残值，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>K</mi><mtext>credit</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K_{\\text{credit}}(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">credit</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是合同约定可抵扣的已付租金累计额（rent credit），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span></span></span></span></span> 是平台设置的价格下限（通常为当年残值的某个百分比，防止提前买断侵蚀毛利）。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 本身随租次与时间单调递减：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>  </mtext><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>ref</mtext></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>d</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>m</mi></msup><mo>⋅</mo><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>grade</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R(t) \\;=\\; P_{\\text{ref}}\\cdot(1-d)^{m}\\cdot g(\\text{grade})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">ref</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7144em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">grade</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>ref</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{\\text{ref}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">ref</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是该型号全新参考价，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span> 是按租次计的折旧率，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span> 是已租次数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>grade</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g(\\text{grade})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">grade</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是质检分级折价函数（A 级接近 1，D 级趋近 0.25）。注意 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>K</mi><mtext>credit</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K_{\\text{credit}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">credit</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与「已付租金总额」不是一回事：租转售合同通常只把每期租金的一部分计为买断抵扣，另一部分计为「使用权租金」（rental charge）——这部分在监管定性上决定了整笔交易是租赁还是分期信贷。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[租客发起买断请求] --&gt; B[锁定转换时点 t&lt;br/&gt;合同日 vs 结算日]&#10;  B --&gt; C[取资产当前残值 R t&lt;br/&gt;按租次+分级折旧]&#10;  C --&gt; D[累计已付租金抵扣 K t]&#10;  D --&gt; E{合同是否含买断权&lt;br/&gt;purchase option?}&#10;  E --&gt;|是·费率已含| F[按合同价买断&lt;br/&gt;不再另计费息]&#10;  E --&gt;|否·需重定价| G[按当前残值重定价&lt;br/&gt;补计资金成本]&#10;  F --&gt; H[税务与币种结算]&#10;  G --&gt; H&#10;  H --&gt; I[所有权转移&lt;br/&gt;资产 ID 解绑 + 出库]&#10;  I --&gt; J[更新资产履历&lt;br/&gt;状态=已售出]\">flowchart TD\n  A[租客发起买断请求] --&gt; B[锁定转换时点 t&lt;br/&gt;合同日 vs 结算日]\n  B --&gt; C[取资产当前残值 R t&lt;br/&gt;按租次+分级折旧]\n  C --&gt; D[累计已付租金抵扣 K t]\n  D --&gt; E{合同是否含买断权&lt;br/&gt;purchase option?}\n  E --&gt;|是·费率已含| F[按合同价买断&lt;br/&gt;不再另计费息]\n  E --&gt;|否·需重定价| G[按当前残值重定价&lt;br/&gt;补计资金成本]\n  F --&gt; H[税务与币种结算]\n  G --&gt; H\n  H --&gt; I[所有权转移&lt;br/&gt;资产 ID 解绑 + 出库]\n  I --&gt; J[更新资产履历&lt;br/&gt;状态=已售出]</pre><p>转换时点的选择本身就是一次计息事件。如果合同约定「结算日」（租客付款当天）而非「合同日」（发起当天），中间的汇率与折旧都要由一方承担，跨境场景下这条条款的争议远超国内。</p>\n<h2 id=\"买断价格的拆解-残值-租金抵扣-未摊资金成本\">买断价格的拆解：残值、租金抵扣、未摊资金成本</h2><p>把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>buyout</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{\\text{buyout}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">buyout</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 展开成可对账的四个分量，是让财务、法务、客服说同一种话的前提：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>分量</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>谁决定</th>\n<th>跨境场景的额外复杂度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>账面残值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>资产在此刻的公允价值</td>\n<td>折旧模型 + 质检分级</td>\n<td>需按结算币种折算，产生汇兑差</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>租金抵扣 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>K</mi><mtext>credit</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K_{\\text{credit}}(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">credit</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>已付租金中计入买断的部分</td>\n<td>合同条款（典型 40%–80%）</td>\n<td>部分司法辖区限制抵扣上限</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>未摊资金成本</td>\n<td>提前买断导致的利息返还或补收</td>\n<td>计息方法（精算法 / 78 法则）</td>\n<td>78 法则在多国被消费者保护法限制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>清结算费用</td>\n<td>汇兑、税、手续费</td>\n<td>支付通道 + 税基</td>\n<td>增值税/关税在买断时点的判定</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>提前买断的利息处理</strong>是争议最集中处。两种主流计息法给出不同结果：<strong>精算法</strong>（actuarial method）按实际未偿本金逐期计息，提前还款自然省息；<strong>78 法则</strong>（Rule of 78 / sum-of-the-digits）把利息前置，提前还款省下的利息远少于精算法。美国多州对消费信贷的提前还款返利有专门规定，且《贷款真实性法》（Truth in Lending Act, 15 U.S.C. §1601）与其实施细则 Reg Z 要求披露融资费用与年化率（APR）。跨境平台若在一个司法辖区用 78 法则计算买断返利、在另一个辖区用精算法，客服给出的报价单会被用户直接对比投诉，因此<strong>计息法必须成为合同显性条款而非内部实现细节</strong>。</p>\n<p>提前买断的逻辑可以写成一个等值判据：租客选择买断当且仅当</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>买断价</mtext><mo>+</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><mfrac><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>ρ</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>i</mi></msup></mrow></mfrac><mtext>  </mtext><mo>&lt;</mo><mtext>  </mtext><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><mfrac><msub><mtext>新租替代成本</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>ρ</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>i</mi></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{买断价} + \\sum_{i=t}^{n}\\frac{r_{i}}{(1+\\rho)^{i}} \\;&lt;\\; \\sum_{i=t}^{n}\\frac{\\text{新租替代成本}_{i}}{(1+\\rho)^{i}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">买断价</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.9291em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6514em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1076em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7507em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.9291em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6514em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7507em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">新租替代成本</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span></span></span></span></span> 是租客的贴现率。平台无法观测 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span></span></span></span></span>，但可以通过<strong>买断报价的有效期</strong>（例如 7 天）来限制套利：租客不能在残值下跌后回头锁定旧报价。</p>\n<h2 id=\"会计与税务定性-经营租赁还是融资租赁-决定买断价的合法性\">会计与税务定性：经营租赁还是融资租赁，决定买断价的合法性</h2><p>同一笔「租金 + 买断」，在不同定性下是两种完全不同的交易，而这个定性直接约束了买断价 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span></span></span></span></span> 的下限。</p>\n<p><strong>会计准则侧。</strong> IFRS 16（IASB）要求承租人把几乎全部租赁确认使用权资产与租赁负债，唯一豁免是短期租赁（≤12 个月）与低价值资产租赁；判断租期时，如果承租人「合理确定」（reasonably certain）会行使购买选择权，则该权利覆盖的期间计入租期。ASC 842（FASB）采用同一「合理确定」语义。对出租人，租赁须分类为销售型租赁、直接融资租赁或经营租赁——<strong>一旦合同包含实质性购买选择权，出租人侧大概率被归为销售型租赁</strong>，资产从资产负债表出表、确认销售损益，买断价的高低直接影响这笔损益的确认时点与金额。因此买断定价不是运营自由，而是被出表规则反向约束的。</p>\n<p><strong>税务侧（美国）。</strong> 判断一笔交易是「真租赁」（true lease，租金可税前扣除）还是「附条件销售」（conditional sale，须按分期付款处理）的核心，是 IRS 在 Rev. Proc. 2001-28 中给出的安全港：租赁期末资产的<strong>未恢复残值不得低于原成本的 20%</strong>、租期结束后承租人不得享有名义价格购买权、且剩余经济寿命须达原寿命的 20% 以上且不短于 1 年等。租赁期末的<strong>剩余价值保险</strong>（residual value insurance）在满足条件时可计入残值。工程含义非常直接：<strong>把一个 $1 或 1% 的期末买断价写进合同，会让整笔交易在美国税法下失去真租赁待遇</strong>，租金不再可全额扣除，且可能被重新定性为分期销售而适用不同的披露义务。所以跨境平台的 RTO 买断价下限 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span></span></span></span></span> 通常被设在残值的某个显著比例（常见 10%–25%），而不是象征性金额。</p>\n<p><strong>消费者保护侧。</strong> 美国各州以 Rental-Purchase Agreement Act（租赁-购买协议法）规制 RTO，对「租金抵扣比例上限」「提前买断权利」「总成本披露」有硬性条款；欧盟《消费者信贷指令》(EU) 2023/2225 将带购买义务或购买选择权的租赁纳入信贷监管范围，成员国须在 2026 年 11 月前完成转化。这意味着<strong>跨境平台在同一套买断算法上，必须按目的地注入不同的合规参数</strong>——抵扣比例上限、冷静期、披露模板都是按辖区切换的策略，而不是一个全局常量。</p>\n<h2 id=\"跨境多币种买断结算-汇率-税基与资金流\">跨境多币种买断结算：汇率、税基与资金流</h2><p>残值是在资产采购币种下建立的，买断价却在租客所在币种下收付，中间必然经过 IAS 21 定义的外币折算。三个工程要点：</p>\n<p><strong>其一，残值币种与报价币种分离。</strong> 内部残值账本保持采购币种（例如 USD），对外报价按结算日汇率折算并加一个<strong>报价点差</strong>（通常 0.5%–2%）覆盖锁汇成本。报价附带有效期是必需的，否则汇率波动时平台单方面承担敞口。</p>\n<p><strong>其二，买断的税务时点独立于租金。</strong> 租金属于服务/使用权交易，买断属于货物销售，两者的增值税/关税判定不同。跨境买断可能触发进口环节的关税与增值税——如果资产原本以「临时进口」（如 ATA 单证册或暂准进口制度）方式出境，买断意味着临时进口状态终止，需补缴进口税。这笔成本必须进入买断报价模型，否则平台会在结算日发现「收的钱不够交税」。B2C 场景下还涉及目的地国的低值货物免税额度（de minimis）判定，高价值租赁资产的买断几乎必然超额。</p>\n<p><strong>其三，资金流与所有权流对齐。</strong> 所有权转移（asset ID 解绑、出库、履历更新）必须以「资金已确认到账」为前置门，而非「支付通道返回成功」——跨境卡支付的授权与清算存在时滞，授权成功不等于资金不可撤销。工程上落成状态门：<code>BUYOUT_QUOTED → PAYMENT_CLEARED → OWNERSHIP_TRANSFERRED → ASSET_DEREGISTERED</code>，任一环节失败回退人工而非自动重试划款。</p>\n<h2 id=\"提前终止与违约-买断之外的替代路径\">提前终止与违约：买断之外的替代路径</h2><p>租客还不上租金时，平台面对的不是买断而是处置。可选的路径及各自的结算逻辑：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>路径</th>\n<th>触发条件</th>\n<th>结算方式</th>\n<th>风险</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>友好买断</td>\n<td>租客主动提出</td>\n<td>按 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>buyout</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{\\text{buyout}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">buyout</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 结算</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>提前终止</td>\n<td>租客申请解约</td>\n<td>支付提前终止费 + 已用租金，资产归还</td>\n<td>中，取决于终止费合法性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>回收（repossession）</td>\n<td>逾期达到阈值</td>\n<td>收回资产，按残值冲抵欠款</td>\n<td>高，涉及差额债权（deficiency）追偿</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>转租转售</td>\n<td>平台撮合</td>\n<td>第三方买断，租客债权结清</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>差额债权（deficiency balance）</strong> 是违约场景下最尖锐的问题：回收资产再售所得低于未偿总额时，差额是否可向租客追偿，在美国因州而异——部分州禁止对 RTO 情形追偿差额，理由是 RTO 在州法下被视为租赁而非贷款。跨境平台若把美国某州的合同模板直接套用于另一辖区，很可能产生不可执行的条款。工程上应把「可追偿差额」建模为辖区级的布尔策略，而非统一的法律假设。</p>\n<p>违约处置还要与反欺诈联动：押金授权（deposit authorization）在违约时能否扣划、扣划上限、以及是否触发<a href=\"../booking-pricing-deposit-risk/rental-fraud-deposit-auth-risk-control\">租赁反欺诈与押金授权风控</a>中的账户级封禁，是同一套决策链的两个出口。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>买断价是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>buyout</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>R</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>K</mi><mtext>credit</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>F</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{\\text{buyout}}(t)=\\max(R(t)-K_{\\text{credit}}(t),F)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">buyout</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">credit</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，残值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 随租次与分级折旧递减，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span></span></span></span></span> 是防止侵蚀毛利的残值下限。</li>\n<li>租金抵扣 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>K</mi><mtext>credit</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K_{\\text{credit}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">credit</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 只覆盖已付租金的一部分，另一部分是使用权租金——这条边界决定了交易被定性为租赁还是分期信贷。</li>\n<li>计息法（精算法 vs 78 法则）决定提前买断省多少息，且在多国受消费者保护法限制，必须写成合同显性条款。</li>\n<li>会计上，含实质购买选择权的合同在出租人侧常被归为销售型租赁；税务上，美国 Rev. Proc. 2001-28 要求期末未恢复残值不低于原成本 20% 才算真租赁——名义买断价会击穿这个安全港。</li>\n<li>跨境结算要把残值币种与报价币种分离、把买断的进口税/增值税计入报价、并以资金清算到账（而非授权成功）作为所有权转移门。</li>\n<li>违约场景的差额债权可否追偿按辖区而异，应建模为辖区级策略，不能复用他州模板。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>转换结算把租赁的「使用权」平滑地接到「所有权」上，而这条接缝两侧的定价、会计与合规规则完全不同——写清楚它，等于给整个租转售产品线划出一条可审计的结算边界。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"租转售转换与残值买断结算：把「已付租金」折算成「买断成交价」","id":"租转售转换与残值买断结算-把-已付租金-折算成-买断成交价"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：买断价是「残值减去已付租金抵扣」，不是「打折出售」","id":"核心概念-买断价是-残值减去已付租金抵扣-不是-打折出售"},{"level":2,"text":"买断价格的拆解：残值、租金抵扣、未摊资金成本","id":"买断价格的拆解-残值-租金抵扣-未摊资金成本"},{"level":2,"text":"会计与税务定性：经营租赁还是融资租赁，决定买断价的合法性","id":"会计与税务定性-经营租赁还是融资租赁-决定买断价的合法性"},{"level":2,"text":"跨境多币种买断结算：汇率、税基与资金流","id":"跨境多币种买断结算-汇率-税基与资金流"},{"level":2,"text":"提前终止与违约：买断之外的替代路径","id":"提前终止与违约-买断之外的替代路径"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"跨境租赁临时进出口与关税处理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/rental-access-commerce-reservation-inventory-asset-lifecycle/crossborder-rent-to-own-platform-governance/crossborder-rental-temporary-admission-customs"},"next":{"title":"租赁平台治理、政策合规与运营度量","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/rental-access-commerce-reservation-inventory-asset-lifecycle/crossborder-rent-to-own-platform-governance/rental-platform-governance-compliance-metrics"}}